  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　とっきから　サイコパワーを\nはなつとき　とても　みみざわりな\nはぎしりの　おとが　あたりに　ひびく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 돌기에서 사이코 파워를\n발산할 때 아주 귀에 거슬리는\n이가는 소리가 주변에 울려 퍼진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從頭部的突起物發出精神力量的時候，\n周圍會響起非常刺耳的磨牙聲。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il utilise l’appendice sur sa tête pour\nprojeter ses pouvoirs psychiques, il émet un\nbruit aussi irritant qu’un grincement de dents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es über den Fortsatz an seinem Kopf\nPsycho-Kräfte freisetzt, ertönt in seiner\nUmgebung ein unangenehmes Zähneknirschen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando la protuberancia que tiene en la cabeza\nemite poderes psíquicos, se escucha como un\nruido de dientes rechinando muy molesto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando proietta il suo potere psichico dalla\nprotuberanza sulla testa, diffonde tutto intorno\nun fastidioso rumore di denti che stridono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it unleashes its psychic power from the\nprotuberance on its head, the grating sound\nof grinding teeth echoes through the area.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　突起から　サイコパワーを\n放つとき　とても　耳障りな\n歯ぎしりの　音が　あたりに　響く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从头部的突起物放出精神力量的时候，\n周围会响起非常刺耳的磨牙声。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando la protuberancia que tiene en la cabeza\nemite poderes psíquicos, se escucha como un\nruido de dientes rechinando muy molesto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ねんりきで　えものを　しびれさせ\nじょうぶな　はで　かみくだく。\nシェルダーの　カラでも　よゆうだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "염동력으로 먹이를 마비시켜\n튼튼한 이빨로 깨물어 부순다.\n셀러의 껍질도 거뜬히 부순다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用念力令獵物麻痺後，\n再用結實的牙齒將其咬碎。\n即使是大舌貝的殼也毫不費力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il engourdit ses proies grâce à sa force mentale\navant de les dévorer avec ses grosses dents.\nIl peut briser les Kokiyas sans problème.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lähmt seine Beute mit Psycho-Kräften und\nzerkaut sie mit seinen kräftigen Zähnen. Auch\ndie Schale von Muschas knackt es problemlos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Paraliza a su presa con poderes telequinéticos\ny la hace picadillo con su robusta dentadura.\nNi siquiera Shellder se le resiste.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Paralizza le prede con la telecinesi e le addenta\ncon le sue robuste zanne, capaci di frantumare\npersino il guscio di uno Shellder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stuns its prey with psychokinesis and then\ngrinds them to mush with its strong teeth.\nEven Shellder’s shell is no match for it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "念力で　獲物を　しびれさせ\n丈夫な　歯で　噛み砕く。\nシェルダーの　殻でも　よゆうだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用念力让猎物麻痹，\n用结实的牙齿将其咬碎。\n即使是大舌贝的壳也不在话下。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Paraliza a su presa con poderes telequinéticos\ny la hace picadillo con su robusta dentadura.\nNi siquiera Shellder se le resiste.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すなに　もぐり　あたまの　とっきから\nサイコパワーを　ほうしゃ。　あたりの\nようすを　さぐりつつ　えものを　まつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "모래로 숨어들어 머리의 돌기에서\n사이코 파워를 방사한다. 주변의\n상태를 탐지하면서 먹이를 기다린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會潛藏在沙子裡，\n從頭部的突起物發射精神力量，\n在探查周圍狀況的同時等待獵物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Enfoui dans le sable, il projette ses pouvoirs\npsychiques via l’appendice qu’il a sur la tête,\net scanne les environs en attendant sa proie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es vergräbt sich im Sand und setzt über den\nFortsatz an seinem Kopf Psycho-Kräfte frei. So\nscannt es die Gegend ab und wartet auf Beute.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Oculto bajo la arena, emite poderes psíquicos\npor la protuberancia de su cabeza. Analiza el\nentorno mientras espera a que caiga su presa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nasconde nella sabbia ed emette il suo potere\npsichico dalla protuberanza sulla testa. Aspetta\nla preda sorvegliando l’ambiente che lo circonda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It burrows beneath the sand, radiating\npsychic power from the protuberance on its\nhead. It waits for prey as it surveys the area.",
